WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.410
 From Potsdam in Brandenburg, Germany, the latest from podnews.net

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:05.520
 with Soundstack.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:10.950
 The audio fiction podcast network Fable & Folly is to close at

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.840
 the end of the year.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:16.310
 The network blames a change in podcast advertising for its

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:16.860
 closure,

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:20.500
 but the network says that the shows you love aren't going away,

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.680
 they're just headed to new homes.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.820
 Through the end of the year, the company is helping producers

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.300
 migrate their shows

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:30.360
 and connect with new hosting and advertising partners.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:35.050
 After we revealed that Apple Podcasts has dropped country-specific
